      <h2>Our Story</h2>
      <p>
        Sweet Crumb Artisan Bakery started in 2019 as a single kitchen counter operation,
        baking loaves for neighbours who wanted bread without preservatives or shortcuts.
        Word spread quickly, and today we bake hundreds of loaves, cakes, and pastries
        every single morning — still using the same slow-fermentation recipes we started with.
      </p>
      <p>
        Every item on our menu is made in small batches with real butter, unbleached flour,
        and no artificial preservatives. We believe good bread and good cake shouldn't need
        a long ingredient list to taste amazing.
      </p>
      <h2>What Makes Us Different</h2>
      <ul class="checklist">
        <li>Baked fresh daily — nothing sits on a shelf overnight</li>
        <li>Small-batch recipes, made by real bakers, not factories</li>
        <li>Locally sourced flour, dairy, and fruit whenever possible</li>
        <li>Custom cake orders for birthdays, weddings, and celebrations</li>
        <li>Transparent ingredients listed on every product page</li>
      </ul>
